const DEFAULT_RULES = `Nominations are free.
Nominations are not votes.
A verified student may nominate one candidate per category.
The same candidate may be nominated by different students.
Duplicate submissions from the same nominator in the same category will not increase the count.
False, abusive or unverifiable submissions may be rejected.
Nomination totals do not automatically guarantee shortlisting unless the published rules state otherwise.
Eligibility requirements still apply.
Nominee identities remain private during the open-nomination period.
Shortlisted nominees will be contacted for verification and consent before publication.
Phone numbers and Student IDs will never be displayed publicly.
Public voting will open only after the official nominees are announced.
Special Recognition is selected by the committee and is not open to public nominations.`;

